        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_8",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_9",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_10",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_11",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_14",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_15",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_16"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PERUNTUKAN AM Pindaan seksyen 77"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_III",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "III",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_III__cl_17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PERUNTUKAN KHAS Anggaran cukai yang kena dibayar bagi tahun taksiran 2001"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_III__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Bagi tahun taksiran 2001 anggaran cukai yang kena dibayar yang dikemukakan kepada Ketua Pengarah di bawah subseksyen 107c(2) Akta ibu tidak boleh kurang daripada jumlah cukai yang kena dibayar bagi tahun taksiran 1999."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 106(3) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"section 103(4), (5) or (5A)\" dengan perkataan \"section 103(4), 103(5), 103(5A), 103A(4), 103A(5), 103A(6), 103A(7), 103A(8) or 103A(9)\". Pindaan seksyen 107B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 107B(l) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"applies\" perkataan \"and a company to which section 107c applies\". Seksyen baru 107c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_8",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_9",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_10",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_11",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_12"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 107B seksyen yang berikut:\""
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "\"Estimate 107c. (1) Every company shall for each year of payabie assessment furnish to the Director General an estimate and of its tax payable. payment by instalments (2) Except as provided in subsection (4)(a) the estimate companies of tax payable for a year of assessment shall be made in the prescribed form and furnished to the Director General not later than thirty days before the beginning of the basis period for that year of assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_10",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Where the tax payable under an assessment for a year of assessment exceeds the revised estimate of tax payable for that year of assessment or if no revised estimate is furnished, the estimate of tax payable for that year of assessment, by an amount of more than thirty per cent of the tax payable under the assessment, then, without any further notice being served, the difference between that amount and thirty per cent of the tax payable under the assessment shall be increased by a sum equal to ten per cent of the amount of that difference, and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_11",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the foregoing subsections, where the estimate of tax payable for a year of assessment is increased by a sum under subsection (9) or (10), the Director General may in his discretion for any good cause shown remit the whole or any part of that sum and, where the amount remitted has been paid, the Director General shall repay the same."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_12",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section, \"due date\" means the tenth day of a calendar month.\". Pindaan seksyen 112"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "The estimate of tax payable for a year of assessment shall not be less than the revised estimate of tax payable for the immediately preceding year of assessment or if no revised estimate is furnished, the estimate of tax payable for the immediately preceding year of assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Where a company first commences operation in a year of assessment -"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "the estimate of its tax payable for that year of assessment shall be made in the prescribed form and furnished to the Director General within three months from the date of commencement of operations; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "subsections (2) and (3) shall apply to the company beginning from the second year of assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Where an estimate of tax payable for a year of assessment has been furnished in accordance with subsection (2), that amount shall be paid to the Director General in equal monthly instalments determined according to the number of months in the basis period and each instalment shall be paid by the due date beginning from the second month of the basis period for the year of assessment in respect of which that estimate has been furnished."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Where an estimate of tax payable for a year of assessment has been furnished in accordance with subsection (4)(a), that amount shall be paid to the Director General in equal monthly instalments determined according to the number of months in the basis period and each instalment shall be paid by the due date beginning from the sixth month of the basis period for the year of assessment in respect of which that estiraate has been furnished."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_7__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "A company may in the sixth month of the basis period for a year of assessment furnish to the Director General a revised estimate of its tax payable for that year in the prescribed form and -"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "where the revised estimate exceeds the amount of instalments that have been paid for that year, the difference shall be payable in the remaining instalments in equal proportion; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "where the amount of instalments that have been paid for that year exceeds the revised estimate, the remaining instalments shall cease immediately."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding subsections (1), (3), (5), (6) and (7), the Director General may direct any company to make payment by instalments on account of tax which is or may be payable by that company for a year of assessment at such times and in such amounts as the Director General may direct."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_9",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Where any instalment amount due and payable has not been paid by the due date or on the date specified by the Director General, the amount unpaid shall, without any further notice being served, be increased by a sum equal to ten per cent of the amount unpaid, and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 112 Akta ibu dipinda -"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"section 77(1)\" perkataan \"or 77(1 A)\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2A) Where a person has been convicted of an offence under subsection (1), the court may make a further order that the person shall comply with the relevant provision of this Act under which the offence has been committed within thirty days, or such other period as the court deems fit, from the date the order is made.\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (3), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"section 77(1)\" perkataan \"or 77(1A)\". Pindaan seksyen 114"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 114 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1A) Any person who assists in, or advises with respect to, the preparation of any return where the return results in an understatement of the liability for tax of another person shall, unless he satisfies the court that the assistance or advice was given with reasonable care, be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine of not less than two thousand ringgit and not more than twenty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both.\". Pindaan seksyen 116"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_15__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_15__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 116 Akta ibu dipinda -"
      }
    },
    {
