        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perenggan (d) dengan perenggan yang berikut: \"(d) fails to provide reasonable facilities or assistance or both to the Director General or an authorized officer in the exercise of his powers under this Act; or\"; dan"
