      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 80 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1A) Where the Director General exercises his powers under subsection (1), the occupiers of such lands, buildings and places shall provide the Director General or an authorized officer with all reasonable facilities and assistance for the exercise of his powers under this section.\". Pindaan seksyen 90"
      }
    },
