        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"section 77\" dengan perkataan \"section 77(1)\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/31/msa@/~part_II__cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1 A) Where a company has furnished a return under section 77(lA) to the Director General for a year of assessment, the Director General shall be deemed to have made, on the day on which the return is furnished, an assessment in respect of that company in the amount of tax on the chargeable income, the tax and the chargeable income being the respective amounts as specified in the return. (B) For the purposes of this Act - (a) the return shall be deemed to be a notice of assessment; and (b) the deemed notice of assessment shall be deemed to have been served on the company on the day on which the Director General is deemed to have made the assessment.\". Pindaan seksyen 93"
      }
    },
